# Scoped to @meta only. jarvis's other JS deps (typescript, @babel/*, zod in
# skills/spaces/ts-runtime) resolve from the public registry exactly as they do
# today — making Metaccio the default here would silently change how an
# unrelated, working build resolves every one of them.
#
# https, no proxy, no token: Metaccio authenticates a corp host by network
# position. That is the route a Buildkite agent takes, and bundle-setup's
# build.sh gives the build container host networking whenever fwdproxy resolves
# (see its --network host branch), so the container inherits that position.
#
# A corp laptop running x2pagentd can instead reach the same registry over
# http through 127.0.0.1:10054; ecto1's .npmrc is that shape. Do not commit the
# proxy lines here — they break CI, where no agent daemon is listening.
@meta:registry=https://registry.x2p.facebook.net/
